                {"q": "The style of calligraphy used in Mughal manuscripts was:", "options": ["Nastaliq", "Devanagari", "Kharosthi", "Brahmi"], "answer": 0, "explain": "Nastaliq is a fluid, flowing style that suits Persian."},
